42">Som</span> <span begin="1:12.242" end="1:12.499">det</span> <span begin="1:12.499" end="1:13.060">bästa</span> <span begin="1:13.060" end="1:13.330">som</span> <span begin="1:13.330" end="1:13.596">har</span> <span begin="1:13.596" end="1:14.172">hänt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可最美好的事情不过如此</span></p><p begin="1:36.052" end="1:38.952" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.052" end="1:36.285">In</span><span begin="1:36.285" end="1:36.429">gen</span><span begin="1:36.429" end="1:36.657">ting</span> <span begin="1:36.657" end="1:36.999">känns</span> <span begin="1:36.999" end="1:37.344">li</span><span begin="1:37.344" end="1:37.673">ka</span><span begin="1:37.673" end="1:38.574">dan</span><span begin="1:38.574" end="1:38.952">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">再也没有从前的感觉</span></p><p begin="1:39.755" end="1:42.020" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.755" end="1:40.019">Sa</span><span begin="1:40.019" end="1:40.261">ker</span> <span begin="1:40.261" end="1:40.668">som</span> <span begin="1:40.668" end="1:40.913">jag</span> <span begin="1:40.913" end="1:41.139">ve</span><span begin="1:41.139" end="1:41.273">lat</span> <span begin="1:41.273" end="1:42.020">göra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我想做的事</span></p><p begin="1:42.020" end="1:44.386" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.020" end="1:42.467">Ba</span><span begin="1:42.467" end="1:42.656">ra</span> <span begin="1:42.656" end="1:43.040">göra</span> <span begin="1:43.040" end="1:43.631">med</span> <span begin="1:43.631" end="1:44.386">dig</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只有和你在一起</span></p><p begin="1:44.768" end="1:47.720" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.768" end="1:45.099">Säg</span> <span begin="1:45.099" end="1:45.428">du</span> <span begin="1:45.428" end="1:45.733">känner</span> <span begin="1:45.733" end="1:46.048">sam</span><span begin="1:46.048" end="1:46.335">ma